      "id": "seg:heading:overview:0007:0001",
      "source": "Overview",
      "ko": "Overview",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd532930a85188b45aff6f0a3ed458500c7577e0127a538eb0d100",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "A plane anchor ([`ARPlaneAnchor`](arplaneanchor.md)) describes its size and orientation on the y-axis using the [`planeExtent`](arplaneanchor/planeextent.md) property of this type.",
      "ko": "평면 앵커([`ARPlaneAnchor`](arplaneanchor.md))는 이 타입의 [`planeExtent`](arplaneanchor/planeextent.md) 속성을 사용해 y축에서의 크기와 방향을 설명합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2fb0493961971eb205e887c409d3458da106832d61601102d437cc6f189ae46f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "At runtime, ARKit continually updates the anchor’s width and height as the framework refines its knowledge of the plane’s shape in the environment.",
      "ko": "런타임에서 ARKit는 환경에서 평면 형태에 대한 프레임워크의 이해가 정교해짐에 따라 앵커의 너비와 높이를 지속적으로 갱신합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "43c5254aca79cc77bf0fe764a7d686b45e2d849c7e66be95932b91e99f8f1f76",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "Similarly, as the session runs, the framework may update the plane’s y-rotation to better fit its rectangular area in the environment.",
      "ko": "마찬가지로 세션이 실행되는 동안 프레임워크는 환경에서 평면의 직사각형 영역에 더 잘 맞도록 평면의 y축 회전을 업데이트할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "bbe57265ff53bea98ee0f8fbb790302e93d231b6dcba21bd321b8a201c6f8e08",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "In iOS 15 and earlier, the framework rotates the plane anchor according to that angle.",
      "ko": "iOS 15 및 이전 버전에서는 프레임워크가 해당 각도에 따라 평면 앵커를 회전시킵니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f7c78e090e0489e0a6b2b111b8cd3837799b627517ea1614f3185820eb076fb3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0003",
      "source": "In iOS 16, the framework doesn’t rotate the anchor automatically and its transform matrix remains unchanged.",
      "ko": "iOS 16에서는 프레임워크가 앵커를 자동으로 회전시키지 않으므로 해당 앵커의 변환 행렬은 변경되지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9aead1c327182f42769335baeaf35fc3593c8d081ad6fb991faef0c0ec3dfc22",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0004",
      "source": "Instead, the framework exposes the angle [`rotationOnYAxis`](arplaneextent/rotationonyaxis.md) that you apply to any plane extent geometry in your app.",
      "ko": "대신 프레임워크는 앱의 평면 확장 기하 도형에 적용할 수 있는 [`rotationOnYAxis`](arplaneextent/rotationonyaxis.md) 각도를 노출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "77f2ca4dc36f7fdafa59de2d061b16e94b06a5a4004206ef121094f8393f5586",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: Apps that run on iOS 16 with a deployment target less than iOS 16 preserve the prior y-axis rotation behavior.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 배포 대상이 iOS 16 미만인 앱이 iOS 16에서 실행될 때에는 이전 y축 회전 동작이 유지됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b8ed50c8d0b1b82b062e98cbb5125db084fe3b82c2afc8743136969516616d20",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:size-and-rotate-an-entity-to-a-planes-extent:0012:0001",
      "source": "Size and Rotate an Entity to a Planes Extent",
      "ko": "평면 크기에 맞춰 엔터티 크기 조정 및 회전",
      "sourceHash": "69d6f0165a5a741414fed4b260129d3495d99babd458081d8dc78f91b887b778",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:size-and-rotate-an-entity-to-a-planes-extent:0013:0001",
      "source": "The following code defines a RealityKit entity sized to the plane extent’s width and height.",
      "ko": "다음 코드는 평면의 너비와 높이에 맞춘 RealityKit 엔터티를 정의합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4761053e5dc0556ddbcc0039a846a9ba1a4f4778c5273ffdaa7621c6d044ded5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:size-and-rotate-an-entity-to-a-planes-extent:0013:0002",
      "source": "The helper function also applies the extent’s suggested y-axis rotation by setting its transform `yaw` value to [`rotationOnYAxis`](arplaneextent/rotationonyaxis.md).",
      "ko": "도우미 함수는 변환의 `yaw` 값을 [`rotationOnYAxis`](arplaneextent/rotationonyaxis.md)로 설정해 해당 확장의 제안된 y축 회전도 적용합니다.\n```swift\nfunc createPlane(for planeAnchor: ARPlaneAnchor, material: Material) -> ModelEntity {\n\n    // Get the plane's extent.\n    let extent = planeAnchor.planeExtent\n\n    // Create a model entity sized to the plane's extent.\n    let planeEntity = ModelEntity(mesh: .generatePlane (width: extent.width, depth: extent.height),\n        materials: [material])\n\n    // Orient the entity according to the extent's y-axis rotation.\n    planeEntity.transform = Transform(pitch: 0, yaw: extent.rotationOnYAxis, roll: 0)\n\n    // Center the entity on the plane.\n    planeEntity.transform.translation = planeAnchor.center\n\n    return planeEntity\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "70c8bcd31fb0290b1e9038c795c9d8b895ed31467f2da85eec0180b1c2d2d6f8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:size-and-rotate-an-entity-to-a-planes-extent:0014:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc createPlane(for planeAnchor: ARPlaneAnchor, material: Material) -> ModelEntity {\n\n    // Get the plane's extent.\n    let extent = planeAnchor.planeExtent\n\n    // Create a model entity sized to the plane's extent.\n    let planeEntity = ModelEntity(mesh: .generatePlane (width: extent.width, depth: extent.height),\n        materials: [material])\n\n    // Orient the entity according to the extent's y-axis rotation.\n    planeEntity.transform = Transform(pitch: 0, yaw: extent.rotationOnYAxis, roll: 0)\n\n    // Center the entity on the plane.\n    planeEntity.transform.translation = planeAnchor.center\n\n    return planeEntity\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc createPlane(for planeAnchor: ARPlaneAnchor, material: Material) -> ModelEntity {\n\n    // Get the plane's extent.\n    let extent = planeAnchor.planeExtent\n\n    // Create a model entity sized to the plane's extent.\n    let planeEntity = ModelEntity(mesh: .generatePlane (width: extent.width, depth: extent.height),\n        materials: [material])\n\n    // Orient the entity according to the extent's y-axis rotation.\n    planeEntity.transform = Transform(pitch: 0, yaw: extent.rotationOnYAxis, roll: 0)\n\n    // Center the entity on the plane.\n    planeEntity.transform.translation = planeAnchor.center\n\n    return planeEntity\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "fed7d4651e06118ab53979b2c5f3e13920f2fae61858eb337ef51e9187debe1a",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
